<title>PHILIPPINES: Matsushita sets 20 centavo cash div.</title>
<headline>Matsushita sets 20 centavo cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita Electric Philippines Corp said on Tuesday its board of directors had approved a resolution giving a 20 centavo cash dividend to shareholders as of November 26.</p>
<p>The bonus will be paid on December 17.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
